# RUN: %stinkytofu-opt --arch gfx1250 %s --LiftAsmRegistersToSSAPass=classes=v --RegisterAllocationPass=allocator=greedy-compact,classes=v,unbankable=allocate,apply --remarks --print-output 2>&1
#
# The kernel of allocation_unbankable_bank0_conflict_test.stir under
# unbankable=allocate alone: the ProducerPinMatrix pins fill v0..v247, and
# re-placing the ten scale values in what is left of the bank spreads the
# four short-lived ones over three registers where the producer used two. A
# long-lived one then finds no register below the ceiling, so the colouring is
# refused and every operand keeps the producer's register. That file shows
# unbankable=auto colouring the same kernel by holding them instead.
#
# CHECK: missed: RegisterAllocation: @allocation_unbankable_bank0_allocate: no v register at or below index 255 is free for
# CHECK-NOT: coloured
# CHECK-LABEL: @allocation_unbankable_bank0_allocate
# CHECK: v254 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
# CHECK: v[816:823] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v255)

st.func @allocation_unbankable_bank0_allocate() {
^entry:
  v248 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v249 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v250 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v251 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v252 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v253 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v254 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v255 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v[768:775] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[776:783] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[784:791] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[792:799] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v254 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v[800:807] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v255, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[808:815] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v255, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v255 = "st.v_mov_b32"(0)
  v[816:823] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v254, v255) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[824:831] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v255, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[832:839] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v255, v248) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[512:519] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[0:15], v[16:31], 0, v248, v249) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[520:527] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[32:47], v[48:63], 0, v250, v251) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[528:535] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[64:79], v[80:95], 0, v252, v253) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[536:543] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[96:111], v[112:127], 0, v248, v249) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[544:551] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[128:143], v[144:159], 0, v250, v251) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[552:559] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[160:175], v[176:191], 0, v252, v253) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[560:567] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[192:207], v[208:223], 0, v248, v249) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[568:575] = "st.v_wmma_scale_f32_16x16x128_f8f6f4"(v[224:239], v[600:615], 0, v250, v251) { mod.matrix_fmt = { fmtA = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8", fmtB = "MATRIX_FMT_FP8" } }
  v[576:583] = "st.v_wmma_f32_16x16x32_bf16"(v[240:247], v[616:623], v[624:631])
  "st.s_endpgm"()
}
